{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310","id":6025105121,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_O4Q","number":310,"title":"[消息队列 MQ02] 多个消费者：分工处理，还是每人一份？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:08:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq02 -->\n\n**核心顺序2/9；MQ02是稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开工。** 系列统一以Kafka为技术主线；本片独立介绍必要前提，不要求先看MQ01。\n\n## 独立问题与核心机制\n\n通知服务和积分服务都需要完整订单事件，为什么把它们的消费者放在同一个group里后，可能各自只处理一部分？\n\n固定Kafka传统consumer group、一个Topic和两个分区：不同group各自消费一份；同一group中的实例按分区分工。收到归属取决于group与分区分配，不是消费者实例数量自动决定广播。\n\n## 画面示例\n\n1. 同一组带eventId的订单事件写入两个分区；两个不同业务服务的实例加入同一group，显示各自获分配的分区和事件，指出两服务都需要全部事件的目标没有满足。\n2. 从相同起始位置与输入重置对照，通知服务、积分服务各使用独立group；两组各自遍历同一日志，取得完整事件集合。\n3. 在通知group内增加一个实例，两实例分工两个分区；积分group的完整订阅不受它影响。\n\nMQ02只讲订阅归属与分工。MQ03另讲日志为何保留、提交位置与回退重放；确认、去重和重平衡协议不在本片展开。\n\n## 边界与专项验收\n\n- 固定传统consumer group与稳定分配状态，不把分区独占/实例并行上限套到Share Groups。同组分工单位是分区，不画成任意实例逐条随机抢同一分区。\n- 不同group也需明确起始位置与保留前提，不承诺新建group自动取得所有历史数据；不能靠auto.offset.reset默认值暗造对照结果。\n- 每条eventId分别核对组内归属与组间收到数量；同组稳定分配时不能把同一分区同时画给两个实例独占，增加实例后不能变成组内每人一份。\n- 本例只建立消费路径，不自动保证业务成功、恰好一次、无限保留或故障零丢失。D02仍以观察者模式为主体，关联本片不扩大其MQ篇幅。\n\n## 官方资料\n\n- [Kafka 4.4 Introduction](https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/1156b2752aaa28eafc0b4c4d387e63356793268d/docs/getting-started/introduction.md)：Topic、分区及发布/订阅。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Design](https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/1156b2752aaa28eafc0b4c4d387e63356793268d/docs/design/design.md)：传统消费组与分区分配。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Basic Operations](https://kafka.apache.org/44/operations/basic-kafka-operations/)：消费组进度与运行观察。\n\n## 共同制作依据\n\n系列规则与状态见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)。开工时固定Kafka、客户端、消费者协议及配置，逐条绑定来源，默认生成参考资料附录。教学示意、模型与真实运行分别记录，专项验收不预先标完成。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u